Risks Related to Our Common Stock
The market price of our common stock maybe volatile or may decline regardless of our operating performance and investors may not
be able to resell shares they purchase at their purchase price.
The stock market has experienced and may in the future experience volatility that has often been unrelated to the operating
performance of particular companies.The market price of our common stock has experienced,and may continue to experience,
substantial volatility.During2021,the sales price of our common stock on the NASDAQ ranged from$5.77to$9.47pershare.We
